  `expected`; measured, not argued). fit_nrtl: b_ij = -693.3 K, b_ji =
  1272.4 K over 56 kept points of 2 laboratories (11 discarded): max |dT|
  4.030 K, mean 1.658 K against the acceptance 1 K -> notAccepted.
  fit_nrtl_start2 lands on A DIFFERENT pair (993.3, -656.6). NOT
  PROMOTABLE: max |dT| 4.030 K over the 56 kept points is not below 1 K
  @@EARLIER-END@@

  WHAT IS NOT CLAIMED.  The pair is correct at these pressures and in this
